  message: "P4 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 9ae4abe13f; owner-requested re-check of open P4 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p4_review_11012026/tool1/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Reviewed 2026-11-01 at dev 9ae4abe13f on a throwaway tracker (htrac --tracker-root <scratch>/.agent, auto-sync off). After update --parent X, --parent '' prints 'updated', exits 0 and leaves parent=X; --parent none/null/- exit 1 'cannot resolve --parent'. cli.py:758 still reads 'if args.parent:'; update --help offers no clear flag. The TUI ParentScreen already clears on empty input (tui.py:1472). Same footgun for --pr-ref '' (exit 0, pr_ref unchanged); a fix should cover it too. MECHANISM: _cmd_update gates set_fields on truthiness (if args.parent:) and _resolve_ref has no null sentinel, so the CLI cannot express parent=None; same truthiness guard makes --pr-ref '' a silent no-op."  # f690
